        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "c1209c74-1903-504b-bc0c-dca0d03a0161",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Lightfoot, Rupert Glasson, Cassandra Magrath, Ivan Milat, Bradley Murdoch\n- Films: Wolf Creek, Rogue, Coffin Rock\n- TV Series: SeaChange\n- Organizations: ABC\n- Topics: horror films, Australian cinema, true-event marketing\n\nFacts:\n- SeaChange was an Australian ABC television series that ran from 1998 to 2000.\n- Wolf Creek was ambiguously marketed as being based on true events.\n- Wolf Creek had plot elements reminiscent of the real-life murders of tourists by Ivan Milat in the 1990s and Bradley Murdoch in 2001.\n- Cassandra Magrath played Miranda Gibson in SeaChange.\n- Cassandra Magrath played Liz Hunter in the 2005 Australian horror film Wolf Creek.\n- David Lightfoot worked on the horror films Wolf Creek and Rogue.\n- Coffin Rock is an Australian melodramatic thriller film directed by Rupert Glasson and produced by David Lightfoot.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
